      "name": "Dev note: email formatting",
      "width": 360,
      "height": 300,
      "content": "DEV NOTE: Pencil cannot mix text styles in one text layer, so the email is drawn as a separate layer. In the build this is ONE inline paragraph: \"For any other questions or to share feedback, our Client Service team is available via email at clientservice@evergreen.ai.\" Do not break the line before the address. Only the address is a link: sem-text-action, underlined, href mailto:clientservice@evergreen.ai. The trailing period is plain body text (sem-text-body), not part of the link."
    }
